submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "run_log": "/workspace/output/dataset.traj"
  }
}
```

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/dataset.traj`:
ASE .traj, with all 100 periodic Si64 frames in generation order, positions/cell in Angstrom and calculator energy in total eV. First-frame info contains seed (nonnegative integer); optionally set default_dtype to "float32" or "float64" (default "float64"). The saved coordinates must reproduce numpy.random.default_rng(seed), drawing one (64,3) normal array per configuration.
